    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是個調香師，\n是調製香水的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F500B8ABF99995E2BFF0C000A662F8ABF88FD99996C3476844EBA300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近我想試試用坐騎小羊的\n葉子來調香水……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67008FD1621160F38A668A66752857509A0E5C0F7F8A7684000A84495B504F868ABF99996C342026202600100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以的話，\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶一隻坐騎小羊來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE576848A71FF0C000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E364E0096BB57509A0E5C0F7F8A4F865427FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請將坐騎小羊加入到\n同行隊伍裡再來！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB5C0757509A0E5C0F7F8A52A051655230000A540C884C968A4F0D88E1518D4F86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我猜<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是要分一些\n坐騎小羊的葉子給我！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211731C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F898152064E004E9B000A57509A0E5C0F7F8A768484495B507D666211FF01FF1F00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，讓我採一撮\n坐騎小羊背上的葉子……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C8B93621163A14E0064AE000A57509A0E5C0F7F8A80CC4E0A768484495B5020262026FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我這就去試著調一調\n葉子的香水囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190195C3153BB8A6684578ABF4E008ABF000A84495B50768499996C3456C9300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "坐騎小羊的香水完成了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57509A0E5C0F7F8A768499996C345B8C62104E86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不僅洋溢著如坐騎小羊般的年輕活力！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這厚實的香氣還帶著坐騎小羊那\n能夠產生能量的葉子的芬芳。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D50C56D0B6EA28457598257509A0E5C0F7F8A822C76845E748F156D3B529BFF0100100001BE01000A9019539A5BE6768499996C2390845E36845757509A0E5C0F7F8A90A3000A80FD59207522751F80FD91CF768484495B50768482AC82B3300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這香氣讓我想起了往事呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901999996C238B93621160F38D774E865F804E8B5462300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小時候我曾騎著坐騎小羊，\n在密阿雷市繞了一圈。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F66425019621166FE9A0E845757509A0E5C0F7F8AFF0C000A57285BC6963F96F75E027E5E4E864E005708300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯！這香水在某種層面上可說是\n令人懷念的密阿雷的香氣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932FFF01901999996C34572867D07A2E5C6497624E0A53EF8AAA662F000A4EE44EBA61F75FF576845BC6963F96F7768499996C23300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果能請各種各樣的寶可夢協助，\n我相信一定還能調出其他迷人的香水！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C80FD8ACB54047A2E54046A2376845BF653EF5922535452A9FF0C000A621176F84FE14E005B9A908480FD8ABF51FA51764ED68FF74EBA768499996C34FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到時也要請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳多多幫忙囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "523066424E5F89818ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3591A591A5E6B5FD956C9300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
