      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢的氣味常常是\n和回憶連結在一起的呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
